   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Meet me at the movies....Memories, unlocked</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Memories, unlocked is a dynamic interactive online film program designed to ignite the mind, awaken imagination and foster wellbeing by bringing people with dementia, caregivers and communities together. Our goal is to compile a library of classic film clips accompanied by questions and guidance to stimulate conversation,  engage in meaningful moments by rediscovery of cultural heritage. This initiative includes a training and facilitator&apos;s guide for programs, caregivers and community partners.</narrative>
  </description>
